        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "String methods never return values"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "A String object’s characters cannot be changed in place"
        }
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "explanation": "Operations produce results rather than modifying the original String object."
